\newlabel{fig:missingness}{{1}{3}{Observed-score mask for the frozen MTEB panel, with rows ordered by component. Blue denotes observed scores. Complete anchors define evaluation targets; incomplete histories enter training only when their component is assigned to training}{figure.caption.1}{}}
